Inputlog has been developed for research purposes. 
Researchers may use Inputlog free of charge if they refer to "Leijten, M., & Van Waes, L. (2013). Keystroke Logging in Writing Research: Using Inputlog to Analyze and Visualize Writing Processes. Written Communication 30(3), 358–392 | DOI: 10.1177/0741088313491692" when you publish research in which you use Inputlog.

